<title>UK: Lehman Brothers set warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers set warrants on Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA says it has issued 12 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	  ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  17,500.0	$1.61	   6.92 PCT    10 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	  18,500.0	$1.13	   9.36 PCT    14 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	  19,500.0	$0.79	  12.69 PCT    20 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	   16,500.0	$0.84	  14.32 PCT    19 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT E	   17,500.0	$1.10	  10.47 PCT    14 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT F	   18,500.0	$1.49	   7.46 PCT    10 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.JAN.97-11.JUL.97   PAYDATE	28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
